---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Refund Policy — Rashi Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Rashi Kundali sells a single digital product: a <strong>software-generated,
      personalized Kundali PDF report</strong>, calculated from the birth details you provide
      and delivered instantly and automatically the moment payment completes. There is no
      physical product, no shipping, and no waiting period. What you receive is an in-depth
      planetary &amp; chart analysis — not a hand-written prediction, and not a guarantee of
      future outcomes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Sale Is Final Once the Report Is Generated</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Because the report is generated and made available for download immediately after
      payment, <strong>all sales are final</strong>. We do not offer refunds for:
    </p>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li>Change of mind after purchase</li>
      <li>Disappointment with the format (a standard PDF with charts and readings)</li>
      <li>Disagreement with the astrological content or timing guidance</li>
      <li>Incorrect birth details entered at the time of order (see the free correction below)</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      By completing payment you acknowledge that you are buying an instantly-delivered
      digital report and that it is non-refundable — you confirm this explicitly with the
      checkbox shown before paying.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Wrong Birth Details? Free One-Time Recalculation</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Mistyped a date, time, or city? Instead of a refund, every order includes
      <strong>one free correction within 7 days of purchase</strong>: fix your birth details
      and we regenerate your PDF from scratch at no extra cost. Your delivery email contains
      a personal one-time correction link, or you can request (or open) it any time at
      <a href="/regenerate" style="color:var(--color-primary)">rashikundali.com/regenerate</a>
      using your order ID and purchase email. The link works <strong>once only</strong>, so
      please double-check every field before submitting.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">The Only Refund Exceptions</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      A refund (or free resend) applies only for a genuine technical payment failure on our
      end — for example, you were <strong>charged more than once</strong> for the same order,
      or your payment was deducted but the <strong>report was never generated or
      delivered</strong> despite our retries. In these cases we will resend your report or
      refund the duplicate/failed charge in full.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">How to Request a Correction or Refund Review</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Email us at
      <a href="mailto:support@rashikundali.com" style="color:var(--color-primary)">support@rashikundali.com</a> within 7 days of your purchase with:
    </p>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li>Your name and the email used for the purchase</li>
      <li>Payment ID or order ID</li>
      <li>A short description of the issue (e.g. charged twice, report never delivered)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Processing Time</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Verified duplicate/failed-payment refunds are processed within 5-7 business days and
      credited to the original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email once the
      refund or resend is initiated. Refunded orders lose download access to the report.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Payment Disputes &amp; Chargebacks</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Filing a bank or gateway dispute for a report that was generated and delivered is
      treated as misuse. We maintain server-side delivery records (generation and download
      timestamps) and submit them as proof of fulfilment to the payment provider in any
      dispute. Orders with reversed payments are blocked from further downloads.
    </p>

    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
